msgid "Behavior changes"
msgstr "行为更改"

msgid "Android"
msgstr "Android"

msgid ""
"The source sets configuration for Android export templates has been updated "
"to match the default Android Studio project structure (`GH-110829`_). This "
"affects the directory layout of the Android project:"
msgstr ""
"Android 导出模板的源集配置已更新，以匹配默认的 Android Studio 项目结构"
"（ `GH-110829`_ ）。这会影响 Android 项目的目录布局："

msgid ""
"Files previously in ``[Project root]/android/build/src/`` are now in "
"``[Project root]/android/build/src/main/java/``."
msgstr ""
"之前位于 ``[项目根目录]/android/build/src/`` 中的文件现在位于 ``[项目根目录]/"
"android/build/src/main/java/`` 中。"

msgid ""
"Android manifest file and assets directory have been moved to ``src/main/`` "
"subdirectories."
msgstr "Android 清单文件和资产目录已移至 ``src/main/`` 子目录。"

msgid ""
"For example, ``GodotApp.java`` moved from ``src/com/godot/game/"
"GodotApp.java`` to ``src/main/java/com/godot/game/GodotApp.java``."
msgstr ""
"例如， ``GodotApp.java`` 从 ``src/com/godot/game/GodotApp.java`` 移动到了 "
"``src/main/java/com/godot/game/GodotApp.java`` 。"

msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "导航"

msgid ""
"``AStar2D.get_point_path``, ``AStar3D.get_point_path``, "
"``AStarGrid2D.get_id_path`` and ``AStarGrid2D.get_point_path`` will now "
"return an empty path when ``from_id`` is a disabled/solid point "
"(`GH-113988`_)."
msgstr ""
"现在，当 ``from_id`` 是一个禁用/实心点时， ``AStar2D.get_point_path`` 、 "
"``AStar3D.get_point_path`` 、 ``AStarGrid2D.get_id_path`` 和 "
"``AStarGrid2D.get_point_path`` 将返回一个空路径 (`GH-113988`_)。"

msgid "Changed defaults"
msgstr "默认值更改"

msgid ""
"The following default values have been changed. If your project relies on "
"the previous defaults, you may need to explicitly set them to the old values."
msgstr ""
"以下默认值已更改 。如果你的项目依赖于之前的默认值，则可能需要将其显式设置为旧"
"的值。"

msgid ""
"The default rendering driver on Windows for **newly created** projects is "
"now :abbr:`D3D12 (Direct3D 12)` (`GH-113213`_). This can be changed in "
"Project Settings under ``rendering/rendering_device/driver.windows``."
msgstr ""
"Windows 系统上 **新建** 项目的默认渲染驱动程序现在是 :abbr:`D3D12 (Direct3D "
"12)` (`GH-113213`_)。可以在项目设置的 ``rendering/rendering_device/"
"driver.windows`` 下更改此设置。"

msgid ""
"The default 3D physics engine for **newly created** projects is now Jolt "
"Physics (`GH-105737`_). This can be changed in Project Settings under "
"``physics/3d/physics_engine``."
msgstr ""
"**新建项目** 的默认 3D 物理引擎现在是 Jolt Physics ( `GH-105737`_ )。可以在项"
"目设置的 ``physics/3d/physics_engine`` 下更改此设置。"

